OL,3,GNEWSAJoanna Page says she nearly messed
OL,4,Aup Gavin and Stacey audition           
OL,6,FShe recounted that she was then asked  
OL,7,Fto do it in a Cardiff accent, as that  
OL,8,Fwas where her character was supposed to
OL,9,Fbe from, but Jones told her it sounded 
OL,10,F"awful" and to "just be you".          
